This plugin decodes Palworld save files, which are compressed with Oodle's
Kraken algorithm (a proprietary RAD Game Tools format Palworld uses for its
.sav files) and stored as Unreal Engine GVAS saves. It depends on:

- oozextract (https://crates.io/crates/oozextract), MIT License.
  A clean-room, from-scratch reimplementation of the Kraken/Mermaid/Selkie/
  Leviathan/LZNA/Bitknit decompression algorithms used by Oodle (ooz),
  written without reference to RAD Game Tools' proprietary source. This
  plugin does not embed, link against, or depend on any RAD Game Tools code.

- uesave (https://crates.io/crates/uesave), MIT License.
  A reader/writer for Unreal Engine GVAS save files.

Palworld's type-hint table for otherwise-ambiguous save properties
(`plugins/palworld/parser/src/gvas.rs`) is ported from the
`PALWORLD_TYPE_HINTS` table in cheahjs/palworld-save-tools
(https://github.com/cheahjs/palworld-save-tools), MIT License,
